{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/288781-pacts-b-s-crossover-stuff","id":288781,"title":"Pacts! (B&S crossover stuff )","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-21T12:42:21-07:00","id":288781,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Pacts! (B&S crossover stuff )","content":"I am feeling a little lost here on Pacts and what we can do. I am just going to dive into the scenario. we came to a compromise on what we were going to do either way, but I just wanted to hear from the forums on what we can do should something arise next time.<br /> <br /> &quot;A demon can sign a pact with a mortal and grant that mortal riches (Resources), friends (Allies), wisdom (Skills), health (Stamina) or almost any other benefit.&quot; .... &quot;wise or healthy (within the person\u2019s DNA is the possibility to be smarter or healthier)&quot;<br /> <br /> so here is the situation.. A ghoul (which vampire has defined as mortal ) has been rescued by the character NPC. She is going through withdrawal and is 10 years older than her body actually shows. The deprived condition and the aging has been very stressful so the demon character was like &quot;why dont I just make a pact with her to make her healthy ( lose the Addicted condition ) and correct her stunted growth.<br /> <br /> Does the Demon have to take the addicted condition for his cover?<br /> If that is the case why would someone sell their soul ( or something else ) to be cured of say cancer, if it is only going to kill the demon's cover in turn.<br /> <br /> Since there is no baseline in the book for attributes or even &quot;health&quot; just merits and skills...<br /> <br /> Next, IF they correct the age and the addiction. Who remembers what? Do the other people in the party remember her younger self begging for vitae? Or is it just the demon and the girl who remember?<br /> <br /> Gosh I remember there was much more to this debate when it was happening. Thanks for your input.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T12:49:09-07:00","id":288805,"title":"","content":"Off the top of my head I'd say that first of all, Pacts GIVE things, in general, to the mortal. That means that you wouldn't be taking away her bad health, you'd be giving her good health. (It's the same thing, but the phrasing matters because Pacts). Secondly, I don't see why you'd need to take her Addiction as part of your Cover just to take it away. Maybe her not being Addicted is part of the Pact, doesn't necessarily have to be part of whatever is integrated into the Demon's Cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-21T13:56:36-07:00","id":288866,"title":"","content":"Actually, it depends on if you're taking that aspect of her persona for cover. Stuff really does get subtracted.<br /> <br /> Of course, it get subtracted through the real world acting on the ghoul's part, so....how does one just strip an addiction out?<br /> <br /> THe answer is probably trauma.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T06:44:40-07:00","id":289499,"title":"","content":"a Demon needs to take something in exchange for this pact to work. I did phrase it to make her healthy, but Then what does the demon get? Part of her soul? Could he ask for a favor in the future? her first born child?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T07:18:46-07:00","id":289563,"title":"","content":"Part of her soul, plus anything else it can weasel out of the pactee. But the default is the part of her soul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T12:01:20-07:00","id":289838,"title":"","content":"My understanding is that a demon has to receive something that would count as cover experience in return for whatever the pactee receives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T14:38:47-07:00","id":290020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cmwatford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/288781-pacts-b-s-crossover-stuff?p=289838#post289838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My understanding is that a demon has to receive something that would count as cover experience in return for whatever the pactee receives.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or the other signatory agrees to be the anchor-point of a cult for the demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-23T10:08:22-07:00","id":290604,"title":"","content":"My other question was who remembers this? Do the other people who helped the demon rescue the young girl, remember that she was young or do they remember that she was always the new age?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-23T11:43:07-07:00","id":290695,"title":"","content":"In this case everyone would remember her old age and that she suddenly changed. The only people who are mind altered are people directly affected by the pact that aren't the demon or the one signing the pact. There is no one else directly affected in this case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-23T11:49:31-07:00","id":290698,"title":"","content":"A couple other notes:<br /> <br /> 1. The Demon doesn't HAVE to take anything for the pact to work. The Demon can give out free samples all they want.<br /> 2. What the Demon takes ( a piece of the pactee's life or soul) doesn't have to be the same thing as what is being healed on the pactee. The demon could heal the addiction in exchange for the pactee's job or house for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-24T06:40:36-07:00","id":291261,"title":"","content":"Thank you, very helpful information here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}